    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban The Sale Of Rawhide Treats For Dogs",
        "additional_details": "Rawhide dog chews can pose a serious risk to animal welfare, such as choking, blockages and illness. We ask the UK Government to ban the manufacture, import and sale of rawhide dog chews. Safer alternatives exist, and a ban could protect pets and prevent avoidable harm.\r\n\r\nPet owners and veterinary professionals have documented recurring issues with rawhide. I believe a ban would align with the Government\u2019s duty to protect animal welfare and consumer safety.",
